    "body": "Two returned defects were confirmed. The Study resolver returned before it queried Rockstar's current interaction target, and tagging waited for the observed-compendium bit even though the tag path was the only code that queued that bit. Source now uses the live animal interaction target, lets Study bypass only Recon's aim gates, queues the observed transaction after dwell, verifies it, and then tags. The focused contract rejects eight regressions. The visible vanilla Q prompt is not removed by this source repair; no proved progress-control writer exists yet, so Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#292 remains actionable and this has not been built or installed.",
